<!-- 扫描遗迹任务（QuestScriptDef）。键按 rulesStrings 列表序号编号，定稿后可直接并入 DefInjected/QuestScriptDef/。
     两点说明：
     1. 任务名规则（questNameRules）在抽象基类 RealRuins_ScannedRuinsBase 里，DefInjected 无法翻译抽象 def，
        需要时我可以用 PatchOperation 做翻译补丁（草稿见文件末尾注释）。
     2. 任务过期信件的 label/text 带 TKey="LetterLabelQuestExpired"/"LetterTextQuestExpired"，
        指向原版键，Core 语言包已有翻译，无需处理。 -->
<LanguageData>

  <!-- ===== RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records（翻查档案） ===== -->

  <!-- EN: [scannerName] spent days at the [scanBuilding] going through [sources], and finally [clue]. Checked against old maps, it all points to one spot, a group of ancient buildings, very old and abandoned, but with doors still sealed and all inventory and machinery still inside.\n\nUnfortunately, those sources were never yours alone. [leak] All nearby settlements are already preparing to fight for whatever lies inside these ruins. The treasure could be enormous, so be prepared for a real massacre, not like the usual carefully balanced encounters you've had before. And don't waste time, scavengers are already on their way, and the ruins won't last long. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.0>questDescription-&gt;[scannerName]在[scanBuilding]里花了数天时间仔细检索[sources]，最终[clue]。经过与古老地图的比对，所有线索都指向同一个地点——一片极其古老且荒废已久的建筑群，但大门依然紧闭，内部的库存物资与机器设备也全都完好无损。\n\n不幸的是，这些情报来源从来就不只为你一人所有。[leak]附近所有的定居点都已开始整军备战，准备争夺这片遗迹中的一切。那里的宝藏可能极其丰厚，所以请做好迎接一场真正大屠杀的准备——这可不像你以前经历过的那些“精心平衡”的常规遭遇战。别浪费时间了，拾荒者们已经在路上了，这片遗迹也撑不了多久。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.0>
  <!-- EN: a crate of water-damaged books from before the collapse -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.1>sources-&gt;一箱大崩塌前的受潮书籍</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.1>
  <!-- EN: old survey records bought from a trader for a handful of silver -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.2>sources-&gt;花几枚白银从商人那里买来的旧勘测记录</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.2>
  <!-- EN: the journals of a long-dead exploration party -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.3>sources-&gt;一支早已覆灭的探险队的日志</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.3>
  <!-- EN: a dozen folk tales that contradict each other in every detail but one -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.4>sources-&gt;十几个除了一处细节外其余全都不一致的民间传说</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.4>
  <!-- EN: the ledgers of a trading company that no longer exists -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.5>sources-&gt;一家早已倒闭的贸易公司的账本</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.5>
  <!-- EN: found the same unmarked depot mentioned in three unrelated sources -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.6>clue-&gt;在三份互不相关的资料中发现了同一个未作标记的仓库</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.6>
  <!-- EN: noticed that an old supply route ends at a place no map bothers to name -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.7>clue-&gt;注意到一条旧补给线的终点竟是一处任何地图都未曾命名的地点</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.7>
  <!-- EN: matched a hand-drawn sketch in a margin to the shape of a nearby valley -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.8>clue-&gt;将页边空白处的一幅手绘草图与附近一座山谷的轮廓对应了起来</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.8>
  <!-- EN: decoded a quartermaster's notes about a stockpile that was never collected -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.9>clue-&gt;破译了一名军需官关于一批从未被运走的物资储备的笔记</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.9>
  <!-- EN: Other settlements keep copies of the same books, and someone else was reading them at the same time. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.10>leak-&gt;其他定居点也留有同款书籍的副本，且就在同一时间，也有其他人正在翻阅它们</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.10>
  <!-- EN: The trader who sold you the records had sold the same bundle to every settlement around. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.11>leak-&gt;把这些记录卖给你的那个商人，其实早就把同一份资料转手卖给了周边的每一个定居点</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.11>
  <!-- EN: Asking passing caravans about old landmarks was a mistake, they put two and two together faster than you did. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.12>leak-&gt;向路过的远行队打听旧地标是个错误，他们比你更快反应了过来。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.12>
  <!-- EN: The scouts you sent to confirm the location were seen, and followed. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.13>leak-&gt;你派去确认位置的侦察兵暴露了行踪，而且被人跟上了。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Records.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.13>

  <!-- ===== RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio（无线电定位） ===== -->

  <!-- EN: After days of [listening] at the [scanBuilding], [scannerName] finally picked out [signal]. Triangulation points to a group of ancient buildings. The complex is very old and abandoned, but its doors are still sealed and all inventory and machinery is still inside.\n\nUnfortunately, you weren't the only ones listening. [leak] All nearby settlements are already preparing to fight for whatever lies inside these ruins. The treasure could be enormous, so be prepared for a real massacre, not like the usual carefully balanced encounters you've had before. And don't waste time, scavengers are already on their way, and the ruins won't last long. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.0>questDescription-&gt;在[scanBuilding]进行了数天的[listening]后，[scannerName]终于捕捉到了[signal]。三角定位指向了一片古老的建筑群。这座建筑群极其古老且荒废已久，但大门依然紧闭，内部的库存物资与机器设备也全都完好无损。\n\n不幸的是，在监听的不止你们一家。[leak]附近所有的定居点都已开始整军备战，准备争夺这片遗迹中的一切。那里的宝藏可能极其丰厚，所以请做好迎接一场真正大屠杀的准备——这可不像你以前经历过的那些“精心平衡”的常规遭遇战。别浪费时间了，拾荒者们已经在路上了，这片遗迹也撑不了多久。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.0>
  <!-- EN: sweeping old frequencies -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.1>listening-&gt;旧频段扫描</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.1>
  <!-- EN: pinging long-silent transponder codes -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.2>listening-&gt;休眠应答器代码探测</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.2>
  <!-- EN: hacking into a derelict satellite relay -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.3>listening-&gt;废弃卫星中继站入侵</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.3>
  <!-- EN: triangulating stray transmissions -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.4>listening-&gt;杂散信号三角定位</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.4>
  <!-- EN: a faint automated beacon repeating the same distress code it has been sending for centuries -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.5>signal-&gt;一个微弱的自动信标，正不断重复着它已发送了数个世纪的同一组求救代码</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.5>
  <!-- EN: a cluster of shielded power signatures where there should be nothing at all -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.6>signal-&gt;一簇本不该存在于那片空无一物之地的屏蔽能源特征</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.6>
  <!-- EN: a dormant security network quietly answering each of your pings -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.7>signal-&gt;一个正悄然回应着你每一次探测请求的休眠安保网络</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.7>
  <!-- EN: an encrypted maintenance channel that finally cracked open on the hundredth try -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.8>signal-&gt;一条在第一百次尝试时终于被攻破的加密维护频道</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.8>
  <!-- EN: Your active pings woke up the complex's own beacon, and it is now broadcasting its position on every band. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.9>leak-&gt;你的主动探测唤醒了建筑群自身的信标，此刻它正全频段广播着自己的坐标。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.9>
  <!-- EN: Your triangulation pings were loud enough for every comms array in the region to trace them to the same spot. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.10>leak-&gt;你的三角定位脉冲动静太大，这片区域里的每一座通讯台都顺着信号追踪到了同一处地点。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.10>
  <!-- EN: A passing trader intercepted your comms traffic and is selling the coordinates to anyone willing to pay. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.11>leak-&gt;一名路过的商人截获了你的通讯流量，正把坐标兜售给任何愿意出钱的人。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.11>
  <!-- EN: The moment you narrowed it down, the old security network started answering everyone, not just you. -->
  <RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.12>leak-&gt;就在你锁定具体范围的那一刻，那套古老的安保网络开始回应所有人的信号，而不再只有你一个。</RealRuins_ScannedRuins_Radio.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings.12>

